---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout
	meta={{
		title: "About",
		description: "PhD Candidate at UC Merced studying physics and biology of multicellular networks, vascular development, and cell–matrix mechanics",
	}}
>
	<!-- Site notice -->
	<div class="text-global-text mb-10 rounded-xl border-2 border-accent-2/30 bg-gray-100 px-6 py-5 text-center text-base font-medium opacity-95 dark:border-accent-2/40 dark:bg-white/10 md:px-8 md:py-6 md:text-lg">
		This website was recently migrated and is under development as of Feb 2026. It will be updated soon.
	</div>

	<!-- Polaroid-style image (left) + intro text (right) -->
	<section class="mb-12">
		<div class="container mx-auto">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-14 md:gap-20">
				<div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
					<div
						class="relative -rotate-6 bg-white p-3 pb-12 shadow-lg transition duration-500 hover:rotate-0 dark:bg-neutral-900 dark:border-neutral-800 m-6 md:m-12 border border-gray-100 w-fit"
					>
						<img
							src="/icons/profile.jpg"
							alt="Suraj Sahu"
							class="block aspect-square w-72 object-cover sm:w-80 md:w-96"
						/>
						<span class="text-accent-2 block pt-3 text-center text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider sm:text-xl">SURAJ!</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1 min-w-0">
					<p class="text-accent-2 mb-4 text-xl font-bold">Hello there, I'm Suraj 👋 JOHAAR!! 🙏</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						PhD Candidate in <a class="cactus-link" href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gopinathan Lab</a> at <a class="cactus-link" href="https://www.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of California, Merced</a>.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I work at the intersection of physics and biology to understand the mechanisms that make life "living". I study how a bunch of cells can come together to form a multicellular network, the physics behind cell–cell adhesion, and how cells push, pull, shove, and squeeze their surrounding matrix. I do all of this by writing code (or asking the AI to write it for me).
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						Before joining UC Merced I did my Master's at <a class="cactus-link" href="https://www.nitrkl.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">National Institute of Technology, Rourkela</a>, where I studied how the crowded environment inside a cell (and it really is crowded) can change protein–protein reactions.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						To study all of this I use some theory and mostly computation—neither of which I'm really good at, but I'm excited and motivated anyway.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I have ADHD and OCD. There! I said it!
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						If you're reading this, I will try my best not to let this hinder our working relationship and to be clear in our communication.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						I love learning about how the world works, even though I find it hard: half the time I'm distracted and half the time too focused on things that might not be important. Sometimes it feels like a superpower and sometimes it's just hard to live with. It took me years to be aware of my ADHD and OCD (and it might take a few more to truly embrace it or not be ashamed of it). I want to be open about this not because my therapist suggested it, but so you know that if we ever work together I don't want this to be an issue.
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mb-4 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
						After all, we're all humans trying to accept the things we aren't and deny the things we are.
					</p>
					<blockquote class="text-global-text mb-6 border-l-2 border-accent-2 pl-4 italic opacity-90">
						"Rather than love, than money, than fame, give me truth." — Henry David Thoreau
					</blockquote>
					<SocialList />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-12 dark:border-white/10">
		<h2 class="text-accent-2 mb-8 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Affiliations</h2>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<div
				class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:border-accent-2/30 hover:shadow-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40"
			>
				<a href="https://www.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20">
					<img src="/icons/ucmerced.webp" alt="UC Merced" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</a>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<a class="cactus-link font-semibold text-global-text hover:text-accent-2" href="https://www.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of California Merced</a>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">
						Graduate Researcher, <a class="cactus-link" href="http://gopinathanlab.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gopinathan Group</a>
					</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-0.5 text-sm opacity-75">
						<a class="cactus-link" href="https://physics.ucmerced.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Physics</a>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<a
				href="https://cemb.upenn.edu"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener"
				class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:border-accent-2/30 hover:shadow-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40"
			>
				<div class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20">
					<img src="/icons/cemb.png" alt="CEMB" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</div>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="cactus-link font-semibold text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2">Center for Engineering MechanoBiology</p>
					<p class="text-global-text mt-1 text-sm opacity-75">UPenn</p>
				</div>
			</a>
			<a
				href="https://ccbm.ucmerced.edu"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener"
				class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/80 p-6 transition duration-200 hover:border-accent-2/30 hover:shadow-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:hover:border-accent-2/40"
			>
				<div class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-black/20">
					<img src="/icons/ccbm.png" alt="CCBM" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
				</div>
				<div class="min-w-0">
					<p class="cactus-link font-semibold text-global-text group-hover:text-accent-2">Center for Cellular and Biomolecular Machines</p>
				</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
